{"id":"bajo","lemma":"bajo","pos":"adj","rank":277,"glosses":["short (of little height)","low, ground (situated close to the ground)","low, bottom, poor (not high in status, amount or quality)"],"ipa":"/ˈbaxo/","forms":{"feminine":"baja","masculinePlural":"bajos","femininePlural":"bajas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-bajo.wav","formAudio":{"baja":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/dd/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-baja.wav","bajos":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-bajos.wav","bajas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/98/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-bajas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Mi pulso está bajo.","en":"My pulse is slow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443063"},{"text":"Habla en voz baja.","en":"Speak softly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438906"},{"text":"Dijeron que estaban insatisfechos con sus bajos salarios.","en":"They said they were dissatisfied with their low wages.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611702"},{"text":"Hemos tenido unas cuantas bajas.","en":"We've had a few casualties."},{"text":"Es un golpe bajo.","en":"That's a low blow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/637074"}]}